"included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jinshu033-wang-013","subject_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABE","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AB","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-033","source_id":"s-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p005","quote":"覽孝友恭恪，名亞於祥。及祥仕進，覽亦應本郡之召，稍遷司徒西曹掾、清河太守。五等建，封即丘子，邑六百戸。泰始末，除弘訓少府。職省，轉太中大夫，祿賜與卿同。咸甯初，詔曰：「覽少篤至行，服仁履義，貞素之操，長而彌固。其以覽爲宗正卿。」頃之，以疾上疏乞骸骨。詔聽之，乙太中大夫歸老，賜錢二十萬，床帳薦褥，遣殿中醫療疾給藥。後轉光祿大夫，門施行馬。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-033","source_id":"s-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p006","quote":"咸寧四年卒，時年七十三，諡曰貞。有六子：裁、基、會、正、彥、琛。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"有六子","lineage":"paternal"},"interpretation_note":"有六子承前段王覽，六名兒子分別記父；未據名單先後推絕對排行，並不排除未列女兒。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p005","c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p006"]}}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABE","title":"中護軍","surname":"王","ming":"彥","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-033","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p007","quote":"裁字士初，撫軍長史。基字士先，治書御史。會字士和，侍御史。正字士則，尚書郎。彥字士治，中護軍。琛字士瑋，國子祭酒。","note":"姓名與字分開；同一家世單名依王姓傳主及親屬語境暫分，不把字當本名。頂部稱號為辨認用稱，不表示所有時點均有效。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"zi":"士治"}],"me